      "content": "Alpha Vantage is a financial data platform providing real-time and historical market data for stocks, options, cryptocurrencies, forex, commodities, and economic indicators. The API supports 50+ technical indicators, fundamental data, Alpha Intelligence sentiment analysis, and earnings data, all accessed through a single query endpoint using function-based routing.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Alpha Vantage Support",
